<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Biomedical |</title><link>https://saifrehman945.github.io/tags/biomedical/</link><atom:link href="https://saifrehman945.github.io/tags/biomedical/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><description>Biomedical</description><generator>HugoBlox Kit (https://hugoblox.com)</generator><language>en-us</language><lastBuildDate>Mon, 01 May 2023 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><image><url>https://saifrehman945.github.io/media/icon_hu_1c0e9cb08cfb822a.png</url><title>Biomedical</title><link>https://saifrehman945.github.io/tags/biomedical/</link></image><item><title>Finite Element Analysis of Zirconia Dental Prosthesis</title><link>https://saifrehman945.github.io/projects/zirconia-dental-fea/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 May 2023 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://saifrehman945.github.io/projects/zirconia-dental-fea/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Investigated the influence of cement mechanical properties on the structural response of a three-unit zirconia fixed dental prosthesis (FDP) using finite element analysis. Evaluated how &lt;strong&gt;cement layer thickness (CLT)&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;Young&amp;rsquo;s modulus&lt;/strong&gt; affect stress distribution across prosthesis, cement layer, and supporting bone under physiological loading.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stress distribution across zirconia crown, cement layer, and bone interface under distributed loading.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong sensitivity of stress concentrations to cement stiffness and thickness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Compared &lt;strong&gt;resin vs. GIC cement&lt;/strong&gt; behavior for bonding and load transfer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design insight for improving prosthesis durability and clinical survival rate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
